ithin a TF family and species and a high degree of binding motif conservation for at least 450 million years. The results indicate more potential for evolution in\n                  <jats:italic>cis-</jats:italic>\n                  rather than\n                  <jats:italic>trans</jats:italic>\n                  -regulatory elements.\n                </jats:p>",
